<title>USA: Intelligroup files for public offering.</title>
<headline>Intelligroup files for public offering.</headline>
<dateline>ISELIN, N.J. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Intelligroup Inc said on Friday that it had filed a registration statement for a public offering of up to 1.5 million share of its common stock.</p>
<p>The offering is being underwritten by Montgomery Securities and will be made only by means of a prospectus, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Intelligroup provides information technology services, including system integration and custom software development.</p>
